WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Mara waits outside a memory shop on a rainy street.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Mara studies a glass memory capsule.
Vale stands behind her.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Mara and Vale meet in a greenhouse.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.028
Mara touches a living seedling on a worn chair.
Vale watches nearby.
